{"2631270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Mausoleum for All", "steam_appid": 2631270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/3bbccad238dfeecb821726d2c6de9cea.avif?t=1786792490\" width=780 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your family have been abandoned in a claustrophobic containment zone. Only <i>they </i>aren't your family anymore.<i> </i>With only your pet mouse and your father’s trusty rifle to aid you, you'll fight off the creeping terrors that lurk the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets tear chunks from the undead. Fend off the remains of your beloved relatives. From your second cousin, to your great grandmother, you'll face off against monstrosities with destructible clothing, flesh, and bone that flays and flaps with damage. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/6a1cbae4f3f2715eafa63818ed353271.poster.avif?t=1786792490\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/6a1cbae4f3f2715eafa63818ed353271.webm?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/6a1cbae4f3f2715eafa63818ed353271.mp4?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield the Supernatural</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill up your 'Faith Bar' and throw up your crucifix to stagger  enemies, or use your pet mouse's psychic abilities to blast them away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/64e4b7dd9cc7b57ea6cd8b79604c84d1.poster.avif?t=1786792490\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/64e4b7dd9cc7b57ea6cd8b79604c84d1.webm?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/64e4b7dd9cc7b57ea6cd8b79604c84d1.mp4?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Delve into the Family Mausoleum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no escape above, you'll descend into the rotting depths below the restaurant, where your entire ancestry has been jarred from their slumber. It's time to reunite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/1d7c54bde836f7085791ffa2d06ea7ef.poster.avif?t=1786792490\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/1d7c54bde836f7085791ffa2d06ea7ef.webm?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/1d7c54bde836f7085791ffa2d06ea7ef.mp4?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fever-Dream Survival Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into the depths of horror, searching  for ammunition and gear, all the while fighting off the skeletal remains of your loved ones and ancestors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the  story of a demented lineage sealed in a prison of their own making. Through the eyes of a disabled veteran, you'll explore a restaurant built from the foundations of a Mausoleum. With a talking mouse as your guide, you'll search for a way to break free of a seemingly inescapable nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Instead of health, you'll need to manage your energy as thirsty beasts drain you of life the closer they get. The lower your energy gets, you'll to become slower and weaker. You’ll have to find ways to stay positive and recharge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade your rifle with salvaged scrap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the abandoned 'Token Arcade' and play mini-games to unlock prizes that give unique buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect tools such as a lock-pick and hammer to tackle any obstacle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fend off enemies with a limited ammo supply. Making a choice of when to run or fight is essential to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Family Mausoleum has been waiting  for you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/3bbccad238dfeecb821726d2c6de9cea.avif?t=1786792490\" width=780 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your family have been abandoned in a claustrophobic containment zone. Only <i>they </i>aren't your family anymore.<i> </i>With only your pet mouse and your father’s trusty rifle to aid you, you'll fight off the creeping terrors that lurk the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets tear chunks from the undead. Fend off the remains of your beloved relatives. From your second cousin, to your great grandmother, you'll face off against monstrosities with destructible clothing, flesh, and bone that flays and flaps with damage. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/6a1cbae4f3f2715eafa63818ed353271.poster.avif?t=1786792490\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/6a1cbae4f3f2715eafa63818ed353271.webm?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/6a1cbae4f3f2715eafa63818ed353271.mp4?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield the Supernatural</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill up your 'Faith Bar' and throw up your crucifix to stagger  enemies, or use your pet mouse's psychic abilities to blast them away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/64e4b7dd9cc7b57ea6cd8b79604c84d1.poster.avif?t=1786792490\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/64e4b7dd9cc7b57ea6cd8b79604c84d1.webm?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/64e4b7dd9cc7b57ea6cd8b79604c84d1.mp4?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Delve into the Family Mausoleum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no escape above, you'll descend into the rotting depths below the restaurant, where your entire ancestry has been jarred from their slumber. It's time to reunite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/1d7c54bde836f7085791ffa2d06ea7ef.poster.avif?t=1786792490\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/1d7c54bde836f7085791ffa2d06ea7ef.webm?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631270/extras/1d7c54bde836f7085791ffa2d06ea7ef.mp4?t=1786792490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fever-Dream Survival Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into the depths of horror, searching  for ammunition and gear, all the while fighting off the skeletal remains of your loved ones and ancestors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the  story of a demented lineage sealed in a prison of their own making. Through the eyes of a disabled veteran, you'll explore a restaurant built from the foundations of a Mausoleum. With a talking mouse as your guide, you'll search for a way to break free of a seemingly inescapable nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Instead of health, you'll need to manage your energy as thirsty beasts drain you of life the closer they get. The lower your energy gets, you'll to become slower and weaker. You’ll have to find ways to stay positive and recharge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade your rifle with salvaged scrap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the abandoned 'Token Arcade' and play mini-games to unlock prizes that give unique buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect tools such as a lock-pick and hammer to tackle any obstacle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fend off enemies with a limited ammo supply. Making a choice of when to run or fight is essential to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Family Mausoleum has been waiting  for you.</p>", "short_description": "You’ve been sealed up in a derelict restaurant with no escape, but you’re not alone. Your family has been interred with you, but they’ve changed, and they’re eager to free you of that needless flesh.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><stron